sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Utilisateur
    participant FE as React SPA
    participant API as Laravel (Sanctum)

    FE->>API: GET /sanctum/csrf-cookie
    API-->>FE: Set-Cookie XSRF-TOKEN
    U->>FE: Saisit email/mot de passe
    FE->>API: POST /login {email, password}
    API->>API: Vérifie credentials, crée session/cookie
    API-->>FE: 204 + cookie session (httpOnly)
    FE->>API: GET /api/user (cookie envoyé automatiquement)
    API-->>FE: 200 {user, role}
    FE-->>U: Redirection selon rôle
